<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        THIS NOTE LIVES IN A COMMENT, NOT IN <description>, and it is INSIDE the root element
        on purpose - a comment ABOVE <CustomField> breaks the sf deploy at conversion with a
        misleading "unable to find matching parent xml file".

        PHASE 2 (2026-08-14) - TWO STRINGS CHANGED ON ONE LINE AND THEY ARE NOT THE SAME KIND
        OF THING. The formula line below used to read:
            IF(ISPICKVAL(StageName,'PSA'), 'PSA',
        The FIRST 'PSA' is the Opportunity STAGE VALUE, renamed to 'Under Contract (PSA)' by
        this phase; leaving it would send every migrated deal to the 'Interested Deals'
        fall-through bucket, SILENTLY. The SECOND is this formula's own OUTPUT LABEL - it was
        moved too, so the Deal Tracker does not show a bucket called 'PSA' full of deals whose
        stage reads Under Contract (PSA), which is the confusion this rename exists to remove.

        THE OUTPUT MOVE HAS TWO CONSUMERS AND NEITHER IS IN THIS FILE:
          1. objects/Opportunity/listViews/Deal_Tracker_PSA - its filter is
             Deal_Bucket__c EQUALS <value>, so that value moved with this string. Deploy the
             two together, or the list view silently returns nothing.
          2. classes/ContractExecutionServiceTest.cls asserts Deal_Bucket__c == 'PSA' (one
             assertion, measured 2026-08-14). That is the DEVELOPER half of Phase 2 and is
             listed in requirements sec 6.2 under TEST. It fails LOUDLY, not silently.
        Org-side reports and dashboards filtering or grouping Deal_Bucket__c = 'PSA' are the
        silent ones - they are not represented in this repo at all. Post-deploy gate G8.

        ORDERING: this repoint must land AFTER the P2 backfill. Before it, live rows hold
        'PSA' and this formula would bucket every one of them as 'Interested Deals'.

        The other four Deal_Tracker_* list views filter on Dead, Bought/Closed, Interested
        Deals and LOI - measured 2026-08-14 - so none of them is affected by this change.
    -->
    <fullName>Deal_Bucket__c</fullName>
    <description>Deal-tracker buckets, derived from stage + deal category. Reporting-only projection - automation must branch on StageName/Deal_Category__c, never on this formula (before-save flows cannot read formula fields).</description>
    <externalId>false</externalId>
    <formula>IF(OR(ISPICKVAL(Deal_Category__c,&apos;Dead&apos;), ISPICKVAL(StageName,&apos;Dead/Pass&apos;)), &apos;Dead&apos;,
IF(ISPICKVAL(StageName,&apos;Closed Won&apos;), &apos;Bought/Closed&apos;,
IF(ISPICKVAL(StageName,&apos;About to Close&apos;), &apos;About to Close&apos;,
IF(ISPICKVAL(StageName,&apos;Under Contract (PSA)&apos;), &apos;Under Contract (PSA)&apos;,
IF(ISPICKVAL(StageName,&apos;LOI&apos;), &apos;LOI&apos;,
&apos;Interested Deals&apos;)))))</formula>
    <label>Deal Tracker Bucket</label>
    <required>false</required>
    <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
    <type>Text</type>
    <unique>false</unique>
</CustomField>
